mask_refine.no_mask = Kōṃṃan juon selection ak kobaik juon layer mask mokta.
mask_refine.changed = Document eo eṃōj oktak. Kilōk Kōṃṃan Mask bwe en eṃṃanļọk im bar bellọke.
mask_refine.rgb_only = Jolọk kōļar ko iturin edge ej jerbal ñan layer in RGB. Kōṃṃan mask bwe en eṃṃanļọk ej jerbal ilo color mode in.
mask_refine.too_large = Mask eo elapļọk jen joñan memory eo ej kōjparok. Kōjerbal juon document ak selection edikļọk.
mask_refine.processing = Ej kōṃṃan mask eo ilo joñan eo aolep bwe en eṃṃanļọk… Kwōmaroñ jolọk im jab ukot document eo.
